{
    "title": "Dilemo",
    "description": "Enjoy Pictoline's <b>trivia game</b> with more fun and predicaments from across the multiverse! HEX is an interdimensional being that travels from universe to universe in search of people who can distinguish true from false. Are you one of them?\r\n\r\nDemonstrate your knowledge in different categories, answering cards that will test what you know about your favorite topics. Are you the series and movie expert among your group of friends? The one passionate about history? The best in geography, in science or in general culture? The universe needs you!\r\n\r\n<b>DILEMO</b> is a <b>trivia video game</b> like you've never experienced before:\r\n- A simple, dynamic and (very) entertaining  trivia game.\r\n- Thousands of questions ready to challenge you and teach you new things.\r\n- Special Cards and Game Modes to have fun for hours.\r\n- Temporary categories of dates, celebrations or special events.\r\n- Trophies, prizes and gifts that recognize and reward your knowledge!\r\n\r\nDownload <b>DILEMO</b> and become the Guardian of Knowledge of our universe. Or just to have fun, learn and have a great time.\r\n\r\n<b>DILEMO</b> is a <b>Pictoline game</b>.\r\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/pictoline\r\nTiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@pictoline\r\nFacebook: https://facebook.com/pictoline\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/pictoline",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enjoy Pictoline&#39;s <b>trivia game</b> with more fun and predicaments from across the multiverse! HEX is an interdimensional being that travels from universe to universe in search of people who can distinguish true from false. Are you one of them?<br><br>Demonstrate your knowledge in different categories, answering cards that will test what you know about your favorite topics. Are you the series and movie expert among your group of friends? The one passionate about history? The best in geography, in science or in general culture? The universe needs you!<br><br><b>DILEMO</b> is a <b>trivia video game</b> like you&#39;ve never experienced before:<br>- A simple, dynamic and (very) entertaining  trivia game.<br>- Thousands of questions ready to challenge you and teach you new things.<br>- Special Cards and Game Modes to have fun for hours.<br>- Temporary categories of dates, celebrations or special events.<br>- Trophies, prizes and gifts that recognize and reward your knowledge!<br><br>Download <b>DILEMO</b> and become the Guardian of Knowledge of our universe. Or just to have fun, learn and have a great time.<br><br><b>DILEMO</b> is a <b>Pictoline game</b>.<br>Instagram: https://instagram.com/pictoline<br>Tiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@pictoline<br>Facebook: https://facebook.com/pictoline<br>Twitter: https://twitter.com/pictoline",
